 abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577770/extras/170daa13a1714478239d6d89aa58ae4e.poster.avif?t=1768251782\" width=530 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577770/extras/170daa13a1714478239d6d89aa58ae4e.webm?t=1768251782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577770/extras/170daa13a1714478239d6d89aa58ae4e.mp4?t=1768251782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Spells &amp; Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master spells and techniques that can be upgraded for devastating effects. Level up to unlock new powers and enhance your combat strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577770/extras/3b6f4b8513bc6eb0cbde5e766e151b38.poster.avif?t=1768251782\" width=530 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577770/extras/3b6f4b8513bc6eb0cbde5e766e151b38.webm?t=1768251782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577770/extras/3b6f4b8513bc6eb0cbde5e766e151b38.mp4?t=1768251782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue-like Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience procedurally generated levels with new challenges every time you play. No two runs are the same!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain gold by slaying enemies, defeating bosses and level upping, and buy powerful upgrades and buffs for your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577770/extras/a4d209a14ecc3b87f02ba1fefb3f2f45.poster.avif?t=1768251782\" width=530 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577770/extras/a4d209a14ecc3b87f02ba1fefb3f2f45.webm?t=1768251782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577770/extras/a4d209a14ecc3b87f02ba1fefb3f2f45.mp4?t=1768251782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gameplay Highlights :</u></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new spells as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actual abilities that you can cast, as well as automatic cast spells !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face endless hordes of enemies and powerful bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy rogue-like, procedurally generated levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and grow stronger with every adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy upgrades to enhance your character.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Gabtrex"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577770/6e7c2fa2a34dfcceab8560eee03f6823196e6e4c/header.jpg?t=1768251782","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3577770/862597/e8a079155cca15a24b88255fc390ab723dbb6c03/1750459258/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744272733","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3577770/862597/e8a079155cca15a24b88255